      "doctor_question": "Hello, I’m Dr. AI. What brings you in today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S008",
      "patient_response": "Hi, Dr. AI. Um, well, I guess the main reason I'm here is that I just get pulled off track so incredibly easily. Like, I’ll be sitting down to finish this dashboard I’m supposed to be doing for my class... which, by the way, is a total nightmare because the software we use keeps crashing. I swear it hates my laptop. I was actually thinking of taking it to the Apple store to get checked, but the closest one is like an hour away by bus and the bus schedule around campus is just the worst right now because of all the construction on 4th street. \n\nBut, um, what was I saying? Right, so I'll be trying to work, and then I get one Slack ping from a classmate, or I'll hear a song lyric playing in the background and start thinking about that, or I'll get a random idea for a completely different project. And suddenly I’ve completely lost the thread of the dashboard I was supposed to be finishing in the first place. It just happens all the time.",
